    <item>
      <title>Basic Books</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/livrosbasicos/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/livrosbasicos/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The five books codified by Allan Kardec form the foundation of the Spiritist Doctrine. All are available for free PDF download.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;The Spirits&amp;rsquo; Book&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;the-spirits-book&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#the-spirits-book&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://cei-spiritistcouncil.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/2-The-Spirits-Book.pdf&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;The Spirits&amp;rsquo; Book&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/livros/en-spirits-book.png&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Biographies</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/biografias/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/biografias/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Meet the main authors and figures who contributed to the building and spreading of Spiritist Philosophy.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Allan Kardec (1804–1869)&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;allan-kardec-18041869&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#allan-kardec-18041869&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md biography-photo&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/biografias/allan-kardec.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Allan Kardec&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hippolyte Léon Denizard Rivail was born in Lyon, France, on 3 October 1804. A trained educator and disciple of the renowned pedagogue Pestalozzi, he distinguished himself from an early age as a teacher and author of educational works widely adopted in French schools. His rigorous intellectual background prepared him for the mission he would only discover in maturity: to be the codifier of the Spiritist Doctrine.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>CESF History</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/historia/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/historia/</guid>
      <description>&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/banner.png&#34; alt=&#34;banner&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;🏠 History of the Centre d&amp;rsquo;Études Spirites Fraternité&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-history-of-the-centre-détudes-spirites-fraternité&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-history-of-the-centre-d%c3%a9tudes-spirites-fraternit%c3%a9&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;🌱 Origins&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-origins&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-origins&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Most spiritist centres began with simple study meetings held in family homes, with the participation of relatives and friends. It was from this union and harmony of ideas that many spiritist centres were founded throughout the world.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
