    <item>
      <title>Spiritism and Science</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/espiritismoeciencia/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/en/espiritismoeciencia/</guid>
      <description>&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34; src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/biografias/allan-kardec.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Allan Kardec&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;🔬 Is Spiritism a Science?&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-is-spiritism-a-science&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-is-spiritism-a-science&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By Charles Kempf&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;📖 Definition and Specificity&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;-definition-and-specificity&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#-definition-and-specificity&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The words &lt;em&gt;spiritualism&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;spiritualist&lt;/em&gt; have a very general meaning: anyone who believes there is something beyond matter in themselves is a spiritualist. On the other hand, the terms &lt;strong&gt;SPIRITISM&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;SPIRITIST&lt;/strong&gt; are neologisms — words created by its codifier, &lt;strong&gt;Allan Kardec&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Spiritist Practice</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/en/praticaespirita/</link>
